R .> MAP(RECORD("s", IF(_["n"] > 1, "a", "b"))) .> DEDUPE()
--- expect
SELECT DISTINCT CAST(CASE WHEN (`n` > 1) THEN 'a' ELSE 'b' END AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin AS `s` FROM `r`
===

