### name: plan.textif.mariadb.numeric-results-stay-local
--- note
The witness: MariaDB 11.8 answers 1.0 for this IF's 1, and a DEDUPE over
it keeps one row where SEL keeps two.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"R": {"kind": "relation", "from": "r", "fields": {"N": {"kind": "column", "column": "n", "type": "NUM"}, "T": {"kind": "column", "column": "t", "type": "TEXT"}}}}
--- source
R .> MAP(RECORD("s", IF(_["n"] > 1, 1, 1.0))) .> DEDUPE()
--- plan
pure_memory
--- tables
r
===

### name: plan.textif.mariadb.a-column-result-stays-local
--- dialect
