===

### name: plan.textif.postgresql.mixed-results-stay-local
--- note
A text and a number: not all literals of text, and the translator refuses the
CASE besides (known kinds must agree).
--- dialect
postgresql
--- bindings
{"R": {"kind": "relation", "from": "r", "fields": {"N": {"kind": "column", "column": "n", "type": "NUM"}, "T": {"kind": "column", "column": "t", "type": "TEXT"}}}}
--- source
R .> MAP(RECORD("s", IF(_["n"] > 1, "a", 1))) .> DEDUPE()
--- plan
pure_memory
--- tables
r
===
